Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,Why is the Statue
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.95,0:00:02.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,of Liberty green?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.66,0:00:03.99,Cap,,0,0,0,,Because she wasn't always.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.62,0:00:05.61,Cap,,0,0,0,,In eighteen eighty-six,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.61,0:00:06.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,France gave America
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.60,0:00:07.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,a giant gift: a lady
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.59,0:00:09.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,made of shiny copper.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.05,0:00:09.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,She glowed like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.94,0:00:11.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,a brand-new penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.49,0:00:12.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,But copper has
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.76,0:00:14.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.26,0:00:16.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,When it meets rain,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.49,0:00:17.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,wind and salty
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.59,0:00:18.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,sea air,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.13,0:00:19.73,Cap,,0,0,0,,it slowly changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.73,0:00:21.65,Cap,,0,0,0,,Within about twenty years,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.65,0:00:23.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,Lady Liberty went
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.30,0:00:24.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,from penny brown
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.40,0:00:25.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,to minty green.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.50,0:00:27.11,Cap,,0,0,0,,People panicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.11,0:00:28.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,In nineteen-oh-six,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.76,0:00:30.81,Cap,,0,0,0,,Congress set aside money
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.81,0:00:31.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,to paint her back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.98,0:00:33.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,to copper.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.28,0:00:35.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,New Yorkers were furious.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.40,0:00:37.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,Some called it sacrilege.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.41,0:00:38.61,Cap,,0,0,0,,So engineers took
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.61,0:00:39.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,a closer look,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.77,0:00:41.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,and found something surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.74,0:00:42.75,Cap,,0,0,0,,That green coat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.75,0:00:44.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,wasn't damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.08,0:00:45.39,Cap,,0,0,0,,It was armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.39,0:00:46.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,A thin skin called
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.43,0:00:47.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,patina that protects
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.69,0:00:49.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,the metal underneath.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.35,0:00:50.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,So the paint
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.03,0:00:51.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,was never used.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.60,0:00:52.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,That's why the Statue
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.41,0:00:54.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,of Liberty is green.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.01,0:00:55.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,Her "rust" is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.06,0:00:56.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,what protects her.
